<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { width: 80%; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; }
        .header { background: #27ae60; color: white; padding: 10px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
        .content { padding: 20px; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #27ae60; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>AI Execution Completed Successfuly</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello,</p>
            <p>The AI execution for ticket <strong>{{ticketId}}</strong> in project <strong>{{projectName}}</strong> has completed successfully.</p>
            <p><strong>Summary:</strong> {{message}}</p>
            <p>Time: {{timestamp}}</p>
            <p><a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">View Results on Dashboard</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Dark Software Factory</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
